---
---

<section class="two-doors" id="doors">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="s-head">
      <div class="left">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Two ways to work with us</span>
        <h2>
          Two doors. <em>Same orchestration platform.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <p>
          Whether your team wants to build on Assembly, or wants Assembly to build for you — both doors land on the same orchestration substrate. The choice is about how much your team wants to ship themselves.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="doors">
      <!-- Door A · featured: platform -->
      <article class="door door-a lift">
        <div class="door-tag">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          Most teams start here
        </div>
        <div class="door-head">
          <span class="lbl">Platform · the first door</span>
          <h3>Build on the orchestration platform.<br/><em>Your team ships.</em></h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="bullets">
          <li>
            <span class="bn">01</span>
            <span>We stand up the orchestration substrate — sources, workflows runtime, agents library, identity, audit — in your environment.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="bn">02</span>
            <span>Your team composes apps from pre-built agents and tools, on real data, with no scaffolding to wire up.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="bn">03</span>
            <span>We keep the platform current, supported, and SLA-backed as you grow.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="footnote">
          <span class="kpi-row">
            <span><b>~10 days</b> to first orchestrated app</span>
            <span><b>Single-tenant</b> deploy in your VPC</span>
            <span><b>Per-app</b> usage pricing</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-primary door-cta">
          Explore the platform <span class="arr">→</span>
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Door B · services -->
      <article class="door door-b lift">
        <div class="door-tag b">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          For teams who'd rather we build it
        </div>
        <div class="door-head">
          <span class="lbl">Delivery · the second door</span>
          <h3>We build on the platform <em>for you</em>.</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="bullets">
          <li>
            <span class="bn">01</span>
            <span>Studio scopes the use case in sixty minutes — PRD, live demo, signable SOW.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="bn">02</span>
            <span>A three-person AI-native team (FDE · QA · TPM) ships the app on Temporal + open-source Claude in about ninety days.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="bn">03</span>
            <span>Delivered on the same orchestration platform — your team takes over, or we operate it.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="footnote">
          <span class="kpi-row">
            <span><b>~90 days</b> to live</span>
            <span><b>Three-person</b> team</span>
            <span><b>Usage-based</b> pricing</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <a href="/delivery" class="btn btn-secondary door-cta">
          See our delivery process <span class="arr">→</span>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="aside">
      <span class="aside-tag">Either door</span>
      Same orchestration platform underneath: workflows on Temporal, the agents library, the tools catalog, identity, audit, hosting, SLA. You don't have to choose forever — teams move between doors as their build muscle grows.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .two-doors {
    padding: 120px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .s-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 80px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .s-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
  .s-head .left .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 14px; display: block; }
  .s-head h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--color-indigo-600); }
  .s-head .right p { color: var(--color-ink-500); font-size: 18px; max-width: 680px; }

  .doors {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .doors { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
  }

  .door {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .door-a {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-indigo-600);
    box-shadow:
      0 1px 0 rgba(15, 17, 42, 0.04),
      0 20px 48px -24px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.32);
  }
  .door-a::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-indigo-600) 0%, var(--color-indigo-500) 100%);
  }
  .door-b {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, var(--color-ink-50) 100%);
  }

  .door-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px 6px 8px;
    background: var(--color-indigo-600);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .door-tag .dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .door-tag.b {
    background: var(--color-ink-100);
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
  }
  .door-tag.b .dot { background: var(--color-ink-500); }

  .door-head .lbl {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .door-head h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 2.4vw, 34px);
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .door-head h3 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .door-b .door-head h3 em { color: var(--color-ink-700); }

  .bullets {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .bullets li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-ink-200);
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .bullets li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .bn {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    padding-top: 3px;
  }
  .door-b .bn { color: var(--color-ink-500); }

  .footnote {
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
  }
  .kpi-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .kpi-row b {
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .door-cta {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .aside {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    background: var(--color-lavender-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-lavender-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .aside-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
    background: #fff;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-indigo-100);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
